# Public deploy repo (haleoworld/jmc). Whitelist approach: ignore everything,
# then re-include only the app + its tooling + docs. Personal/reference files
# (resume & bio PDFs, Basic Info.md, data/, legacy/, .DS_Store) stay local and
# are never published. This is intentionally a whitelist so private filenames
# aren't even listed here.
/*
!/app.html
!/README.md
!/DEPLOY.md
!/tools
!/.gitignore
